Oracle fixtures of the Varta Tailwind port (K8 T1)

The expected CSS in this directory was produced by the official Tailwind CSS
compiler, version 4.3.5 (npm `tailwindcss@4.3.5`, `@tailwindcss/node@4.3.5`),
used only as a test oracle; it is not a build or runtime dependency of Varta.

- oracle-candidates.jsonl: `designSystem.candidatesToCss([candidate])` per
  candidate. Selected from the full corpus of 39,152 candidates (every
  utility of `getClassList()`, one modifier per utility, every variant on
  `flex` and `bg-red-500`, and arbitrary forms): one utility candidate per
  family (root without its last value segment) with the shortest output, one
  modifier candidate per root, every variant and arbitrary candidate, and all
  312 class tokens of a five-component sample application. `@property`
  rules are stored once in oracle-properties.json and referenced by index;
  `css` is null when Tailwind produces nothing.
- oracle-builds.json: `compile(css, { polyfills: 0 }).build(candidates)` of
  whole entry stylesheets.

